    "text": "Within the first hour, phone the customer, assign an owner who keeps the ticket, and post it in the regional P1 channel. In hours 2 to 6, update the customer every 2 hours and check other warehouses for stock. If no fix is in sight by hour 4, escalate to the regional support lead. If the P1 won't be resolved within 8 hours, the support lead informs the regional sales manager and the customer's account owner, and agrees a recovery plan with the customer. After resolution, record the root cause category.",
